; `load` needs a space before its file names: `load-a` and `load(a)` once crashed with an
; assertion ("BUG: `load` expects [[fname1], [fname2]]"), found by a mutation fuzzer on 2026-10-30
expect "EvalError" "separated by commas"
    load-a
expect "EvalError" "separated by commas"
    load(propositional)
; a `load` that names no file used to suggest an empty `load `
expect "ScanError" "names no file"
    load ,
